Package: playdrop-cosmic-applet
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: PlayDrop maintainers <playdrop@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/QasimBhb/PlayDrop
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.39), libgcc-s1, libxkbcommon0, playdrop (= @VERSION@)
Recommends: xdg-desktop-portal
Enhances: cosmic-panel
Description: PlayDrop panel applet for the COSMIC desktop
 An optional entry for the COSMIC panel: paired devices with their battery,
 one click to send the clipboard or files to a device, transfers in progress,
 and a stop button while a device controls this desktop.
 .
 It talks to the PlayDrop background service over D-Bus and never opens a
 network connection itself. After installing, add it to a panel in COSMIC
 Settings under Desktop, Panel, Applets.
